<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Your Wadhwani Grants password was changed</title>
<style>
html,body{margin:0 !important;padding:0 !important;width:100% !important;}
table{border-collapse:collapse !important;}
img{border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;}
a{color:#BF2026;}
@media only screen and (max-width:620px){
.container{width:100% !important;max-width:100% !important;}
.pad{padding-left:22px !important;padding-right:22px !important;}
.logo-hdr{width:100px !important;}
.logo-ftr{width:114px !important;}
.hdr-text{font-size:19px !important;}
}
</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F4F4F5;">
<center style="width:100%;background-color:#F4F4F5;">
<div style="display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;">
Changed on {{change_datetime}}. If this was not you, write to us now.
</div>
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#F4F4F5"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
<table class="container" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #E6E6E6;border-radius:8px;">

<tr><td bgcolor="#BF2026" style="padding:24px 32px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;">
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
<td align="left" valign="middle">
<p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#F9C9A8;">Account security</p>
<h1 class="hdr-text" style="margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;">Your password was changed</h1>
</td>
<td align="right" valign="middle" width="136" style="padding-left:16px;">
<img src="https://wadhwanifoundation--sitsandbox.sandbox.my.salesforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015hy000000J2Cd&amp;oid=00Dhy0000005e85" width="136" alt="Wadhwani Foundation" class="logo-hdr" style="display:block;width:136px;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;"/>
</td>
</tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor="#F2672A" height="4" style="height:4px;font-size:4px;line-height:4px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>

<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:28px 32px 10px;">
<p style="margin:0 0 15px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">Hi {{contact_first_name}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 15px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">The password for your Wadhwani Grants account was changed on {{change_datetime}}. If you made this change, you do not need to do anything.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">This email is about the account below:</p>

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#F7F2F2;border-left:3px solid #F2672A;border-radius:3px;margin:6px 0 18px;"><tr><td style="padding:16px 20px;">
<p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#414042;"><strong>Account email:</strong> {{account_email}}</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#414042;"><strong>Password changed on:</strong> {{change_datetime}}</p>
</td></tr></table>

<p style="margin:0 0 15px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">If you did not make this change, act now. Reply to this email, and ask the Wadhwani Grants team to lock your account.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 15px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">You can also set a new password yourself, using the button below.</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:6px 0 20px;"><tr>
<td bgcolor="#BF2026" style="border-radius:4px;">
<a href="{{reset_url}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 26px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;">Set a new password</a>
</td></tr></table>

<p style="margin:0 0 15px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">Wadhwani Grants will never ask you for your password or a one-time code, by email or by phone. If any message does, do not reply to it and do not open its links.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 15px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;color:#414042;">Send your queries by email to <a href="mailto:grants.support@wadhwanifoundation.org">grants.support@wadhwanifoundation.org</a>.</p>
<p style="margin:18px 0 8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#414042;">Kind Regards,<br/>The Wadhwani Grants Team</p>
</td></tr>

<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:0 32px;"><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #E6E6E6;margin:6px 0 0;"/></td></tr>

<tr><td class="pad" style="padding:22px 32px 26px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;">
<img src="https://wadhwanifoundation--sitsandbox.sandbox.my.salesforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=015hy000000J4UZ&amp;oid=00Dhy0000005e85" width="132" alt="Wadhwani Grants" class="logo-ftr" style="display:block;width:132px;height:auto;margin:0 0 12px;"/>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#6D6E71;">Wadhwani Grants, the grant-making arm of the Wadhwani Foundation.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#6D6E71;">Questions? Just reply to this email; it reaches the Wadhwani Grants team at <a href="mailto:grants.support@wadhwanifoundation.org" style="color:#6D6E71;text-decoration:underline;">grants.support@wadhwanifoundation.org</a>.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#6D6E71;">&copy; {{year}} Wadhwani Charitable Foundation. All rights reserved.</p>
</td></tr>

</table></td></tr></table>
</center>
</body>
</html>